"values": [{
"args": [true],
"method": &"black"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["", "TIDEWATER", "previs playblast · story pass", 5.8],
"method": &"card"
}, {
"args": [true],
"method": &"black"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Chapter 1", "The Old Harbor", "", 3.8],
"method": &"card"
}, {
"args": [1.4],
"method": &"fade_in"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_03_TheCrossing")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: This is as close as I go. My boots don't touch that sand. Not for your money, not for anyone's.", 6.625],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: See the dark water past the point? There's a rock out there that sleeps under the tide.", 6.1850000000000005],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: If it shows itself while you're ashore, nobody comes. Not me. Not any boat from the villages. Not at any price.", 7.505000000000001],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: You'd wait till the sea swallows it again. Could be days. Could be a lot longer.", 5.800000000000001],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: There's a trail in the brush. Runs up to the old harbor. That was there long before the soldiers came.", 7.01],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: Scavengers come picking at the base sometimes. Keep your light low.", 5.085],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["CAPTAIN: Find your brother quick. And if you hear something out there... you don't answer it.", 6.02],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Boat engine revs; the boat pulls away", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_04_TheBoatLeaves")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(Elias... what were you doing out here?)", 3.6],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [],
"method": &"hide_note"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_05_Ashore")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_06_TheFallenTree")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(Too high to climb over. I could squeeze underneath.)", 4.050000000000001],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_07_TheRuinedWall")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(Old stonework. Older than anything military.)", 3.7],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_08_TheShrine")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["Whisper, close behind (2 s)", 2.2],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Someone's been leaving things here.)", 3.25],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Stone Shrine", "A crude idol, slick with moss. Its face has been chiselled away, deliberately and long ago.

At its base: fish bones arranged in a spiral, a knot of fishing line, and a child's red bracelet.

The bones are fresh.", 6.0],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(That scaffolding has seen better decades.)", 3.55],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Wood creaks underfoot", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Louder creak", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(It's moving... keep going. Don't stop.)", 3.4],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Loud creak — the scaffold lurches", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["CRASH — the scaffold collapses into the ravine", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(No... no way back down now.)", 2.85],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [NodePath("Cam_11_TheHarbor")],
"method": &"cut_to"
}, {
"args": ["(The old harbor. And a military fence. Newer than everything else here.)", 5.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(Chained shut. I'll need something to cut through that. There was a shed by the west wall...)", 6.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Gate Insignia", "JOINT MARITIME INTELLIGENCE DIRECTORATE
RESEARCH DETACHMENT 9

RESTRICTED AREA
USE OF DEADLY FORCE AUTHORIZED

The anchor-and-eye crest is the same one stitched onto the jacket Elias stopped wearing home.", 5.5],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Equipment Sign-Out Sheet", "MAINTENANCE — EQUIPMENT SIGN-OUT

Welding set — Pvt. Okafor — Pier pylons (again) — returned
Torches x4 — Night crew — Perimeter walk — returned
Rope, 30m — Sgt. Elias — \"Survey\" — sandbar — NOT RETURNED
Bolt cutters — Cpl. Reyes — Watchtower — searchlight cable jammed — NOT RETURNED

— in red grease pencil —
REYES NEVER CAME DOWN.
TOWER IS OFF LIMITS.
DON'T GO UP THERE AT NIGHT.", 9.0],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": ["SLAM — the shed door bangs shut", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(The wind. It was the wind. It was the wind.)", 3.65],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Footfall on the roof", 0.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Footfall", 0.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Footfall", 0.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Footfall", 0.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Something is on the roof.)", 2.75],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["The door creaks slowly open", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(...It's letting me out.)", 2.65],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(Reyes went up there and never came down.)", 3.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Tower creaks", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Deep groan from the timbers", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Don't think about the height. Keep climbing.)", 3.7],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Creak", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Picks up the bolt cutters", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Cpl. Reyes", "The name tape on the jacket reads REYES.

He's sitting against the rail as if he sat down to rest. His fingernails are gone, worn down to the quick. The boards around him are covered in scratches.

His eyes are open. He was looking down at the yard when he died.", 6.5],
"method": &"show_note"
}, {
"args": ["(Reyes...)", 2.5],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["CLANK — searchlight bangs on, electrical buzz", 3.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(The searchlight. Who turned on the searchlight?)", 3.85],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Light dies — STINGER", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(It was watching me the whole time.)", 3.2],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["(Get to the gate. Now. Don't look back.)", 3.4],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Running footsteps BEHIND you", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Breathing, right at your ear", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": [false],
"method": &"slats"
}, {
"args": ["Cutters bite the chain", 1.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["SNAP — the chain drops", 1.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["Gate grinds open", 2.5],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["STINGER — a figure beyond the gate", 2.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Through. Whatever's in there... he's in there too.)", 4.0],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": ["Deep rumble (6 s) — far out at sea, the black stone rises", 6.0],
"method": &"sfx"
}, {
"args": ["(Was that... the ground? Or the sea?)", 3.25],
"method": &"narrate"
}, {
"args": [1.5],
"method": &"fade_out"
}]
}
